                                                "example_id": "8d782996-f182-4f15-a92e-af705ab00149",
                                                "sense_id": "d314e826-c008-364c-89c6-7190a34e7a97",
                                                "text": "Japanese waters also support a rich and diverse shark fauna, including the smallest known shark Squaliolus laticaudus, and the bizarre goblin shark, Mitsukurina owstoni."
